summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproduceable in: 4.5.1, 4.6-beta3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - macOS Tahoe (26.1.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M4 Pro - Apple M4 Pro (14 threads) - 24.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nBoth [`Input.get_joy_vibration_strength()`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_input.html#class-input-method-get-joy-vibration-strength) and [`Input.get_joy_vibration_duration()`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_input.html#class-input-method-get-joy-vibration-duration) do not return the _current_ strength/duration of the vibration but instead only update when a call to [`Input.start_joy_vibration()`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_input.html#class-input-method-start-joy-vibration) is made.\n\nVerified with Xbox Series X controller and Switch 1 Pro controller connected via Bluetooth to a Macbook Pro running macOS Tahoe (26.1)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Call `Input.start_joy_vibration(...)` to start vibration on a controller\n- Wait until the vibration is finished\n- Call `Input.get_joy_vibration_strength()` and `Input.get_joy_vibration_duration()`\n- Expected: strength is `(0, 0)` and duration is `0`\n- Actual: values are the same as what was passed in to `Input.start_joy_vibration(...)`\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/TranquilMarmot/godot-controller-tests","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114843/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114843/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}